<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept importance="optional" id="t00125">
	<title>Auto reverse function</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00617">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00618">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25C065_1.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e00619">
								<li>
									<p>outside rearview mirror select switch</p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The outside rearview mirror will move downwards when the vehicle is in R (Reverse) position to assist reverse parking.</p>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_digital">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>Press the outside rearview mirror select switch (1) to 'L' or 'R'.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>The outside rearview mirror select switch (1) position determines the mirror movement:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<p>L/R: Outside rearview mirrors will move.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Center: Outside rearview mirrors will not move.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>